<title>FINLAND: HELSINKI BOURSE SAYS CLOSES FOR EASTER HOLIDAY.</title>
<headline>HELSINKI BOURSE SAYS CLOSES FOR EASTER HOLIDAY.</headline>
<text>
<p>NO TRADING AT MAUNDY THURSDAY</p>
<p>The Helsinki Stock Exchange offices will be open on thursday 27 March 1997 from 8.00 to 13.00 hrs although there is no trading.</p>
<p>Wednesday's after market trading session II will be on tuesday morning 1 April.</p>
